abstract: >
  QRVerse is a cross-platform smart QR platform built with Expo SDK 57,
  React Native, TypeScript, and Supabase. It enables users to generate
  interactive QR codes for files, images, text, URLs, contacts, and Wi-Fi,
  while supporting cloud synchronization, AI-powered OCR translation, and
  offline file transfer architecture for nearby device sharing.

